# 中频词汇 List02 短语

## 常考短语

- **catch on**: 理解；流行。例：The trend caught on quickly.
- **check in**: 登记入住。例：We checked in at the hotel.
- **check out**: 结账离开；查看。例：Check out this new restaurant.
- **cheer up**: 振作起来。例：Cheer up! Things will get better.
- **clear up**: 澄清；放晴。例：The weather cleared up in the afternoon.
- **come across**: 偶然遇到。例：I came across an old friend.
- **come into being**: 形成。例：The law came into being in 2020.
- **come to terms with**: 接受。例：She came to terms with the loss.
- **count on**: 依靠。例：You can count on me.
- **cross out**: 划掉。例：Cross out the wrong answer.
- **cut off**: 切断。例：The supply was cut off.
- **die out**: 灭绝。例：Many species are dying out.
- **do away with**: 废除。例：They did away with the old rule.
- **drag on**: 拖延。例：The meeting dragged on for hours.
- **drive home**: 使人理解。例：He drove home the point.
